title: "sk-tokenizer-bench"
abstract: "Slovak versus English token cost across 30+ LLM tokenizers, measured on FLORES-200 (Slovak, Czech, Polish, Hungarian, Slovenian, Croatian, Romanian, Ukrainian, German, English), including Slovak without diacritics, and a hand-written Slovak/English domain corpus: token ratios with bootstrap confidence intervals, characters per token, and the resulting price and context-window penalty."
